' Question: which components carry an owner's command to the exchange?
' Explained by: ../05-building-blocks.md, which cites each component. Drawn by hand, high level.
@startuml 05-command-path
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction
[use case\n(start, pause, resume, stop)] as UC
[BotRunner] as R
[BotExecutors] as X
[GridExecutor\n(the bot's worker)] as G
[BotOrderGateway] as O
[trading] as T
UC --> R : IBotRunner
R --> X : the bot's executor
X --> G : one per bot
G --> O : place, cancel
O --> T : IVenueTradingPorts
note bottom of G : every call is queued and\nrun in order on the bot's thread
@enduml
